---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — DekhoYahan"
  description="Why DekhoYahan exists and how we make technology easier to understand."
>
  <section class="content-page shell">
    <p class="section-kicker">About DekhoYahan</p>

    <h1>
      Technology is easier when you understand
      <em>why it exists.</em>
    </h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        We hear new technology terms all the time.
        AI agents. Zero Trust. OSPF. Quantum computing.
        New names keep appearing.
      </p>

      <p>
        But knowing the name is not the same as understanding the idea.
      </p>

      <h2>That is why we built DekhoYahan.</h2>

      <p>
        We start with a simple question:
        what problem was this technology trying to solve?
      </p>

      <p>
        Then we explain why it exists, how it works,
        and where it matters in the real world.
      </p>

      <p>
        We use simple language, practical examples and visuals
        whenever they make the idea easier to see.
      </p>

      <h2>Simple does not mean less accurate.</h2>

      <p>
        Technology can be complicated.
        Our job is not to hide that complexity or make up an easier answer.
      </p>

      <p>
        Our job is to find the clearest way into it.
        When more technical detail matters, we can go deeper.
      </p>

      <h2>Built to be understood.</h2>

      <p>
        DekhoYahan is being built carefully, one useful explanation at a time.
      </p>

      <p>
        We research the subject, check the explanation,
        and use AI as a tool where it helps.
        What we publish is reviewed and shaped by a human.
      </p>

      <div class="plain-note">
        Understand why it exists. See how it works. Know where it matters.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>